WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.376
♪♪

00:00:01.376 --> 00:00:03.128
This is Jamestwon actual.

00:00:03.128 --> 00:00:04.671
Enjoy the show everyone.

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:06.047
♪♪

00:00:06.047 --> 00:00:07.048
Yeah baby.

00:00:07.632 --> 00:00:08.299
Welcome

00:00:08.299 --> 00:00:08.883
-Welcome

00:00:08.883 --> 00:00:09.384
Welcome

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:10.427
to the For All Mankind

00:00:10.468 --> 00:00:11.094
Season 2

00:00:11.094 --> 00:00:11.928
time capsule.

00:00:11.928 --> 00:00:14.014
♪♪

00:00:14.014 --> 00:00:14.973
Time to strap in.

00:00:14.973 --> 00:00:15.765
Alright...

00:00:15.765 --> 00:00:17.017
♪♪

00:00:17.017 --> 00:00:18.309
Welcome to the 1980's.

00:00:18.309 --> 00:00:19.644
♪♪

00:00:19.644 --> 00:00:21.479
Karen now owns the Outpost.

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:23.606
The famous astronaut
watering hole

00:00:23.648 --> 00:00:25.650
and Kelly the
daughter she and Ed

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:27.318
have adopted works
there with her.

00:00:28.028 --> 00:00:29.404
But when Kelly tells
Ed and Karen

00:00:29.404 --> 00:00:30.864
that she wants
to join the Navy,

00:00:30.864 --> 00:00:32.032
Ed is furious.

00:00:32.032 --> 00:00:34.159
Terrified at the thought
of losing another child.

00:00:34.492 --> 00:00:35.452
The answer's no!

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:36.202
Dad, I get to have —

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:37.037
End of story!

00:00:37.787 --> 00:00:39.497
I remember when you told me

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:41.249
that you wanted to join
the Naval Academy.

00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:42.709
And now it turns
out our daughter

00:00:42.709 --> 00:00:44.502
wants to be in the Navy, too.

00:00:44.502 --> 00:00:45.503
We are the Baldwins.

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:47.380
In addition,

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:50.300
tech and lunar exploration
have taken huge strides.

00:00:50.508 --> 00:00:52.302
Margo is now head of NASA

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:55.680
and Ellen is wrapping up
her time on Jamestown.

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:59.059
A massive solar storm
threatens everyone,

00:00:59.059 --> 00:01:00.268
and Molly....

00:01:00.852 --> 00:01:01.853
gets the worst of it.

00:01:03.730 --> 00:01:05.273
Exposed to radiation,

00:01:05.273 --> 00:01:07.192
Molly starts losing
her vision and is

00:01:07.192 --> 00:01:09.152
reluctantly forced
to return home.

00:01:13.156 --> 00:01:14.282
Back on earth,

00:01:14.282 --> 00:01:16.826
Ed is now a putter
swinging desk jockey.

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:20.080
All that practice in your office

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.122
has really been paying off.

00:01:21.831 --> 00:01:24.042
Dani’s yearning to
get back into space.

00:01:24.125 --> 00:01:25.919
I'm trying to get
back to my old self.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:28.213
And Gordo...

00:01:28.213 --> 00:01:29.881
Well...

00:01:29.881 --> 00:01:30.673
You’ll see.

00:01:30.715 --> 00:01:32.717
Don’t even get me
started on the food,

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.928
might as well have
been eating cardboard.

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:36.304
(crowd laughs)

00:01:36.304 --> 00:01:37.263
Ed helps them both.

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:40.642
By getting Dani and Gordo
back into space training.

00:01:40.809 --> 00:01:43.353
Which appears to be
a little easier for Dani.

00:01:48.733 --> 00:01:52.112
While Gordo was expanding...

00:01:52.112 --> 00:01:54.989
His now ex-wife
Tracy is a hero and

00:01:54.989 --> 00:01:57.075
has become something
of a celebrity.

00:01:57.075 --> 00:02:00.120
Traveling back to a now much
larger Jamestown base.

00:02:00.411 --> 00:02:03.915
Meanwhile Cold War tensions
explode when the Soviets

00:02:03.915 --> 00:02:06.126
shoot down a passenger
plane with Americans on board.

00:02:07.877 --> 00:02:10.213
And commandeer our
lunar dig sight.

00:02:10.213 --> 00:02:11.756
Got situation over here.

00:02:12.423 --> 00:02:14.801
So these events force the
Marines we have on the moon

00:02:16.052 --> 00:02:18.054
to take back the site
and protect the base.

00:02:18.304 --> 00:02:21.141
God bless you and
God bless America.

00:02:22.767 --> 00:02:26.062
As things heat up in space,
Gordo gets in shape,

00:02:26.062 --> 00:02:27.147
determined to get back to

00:02:27.147 --> 00:02:29.941
Jamestown to win
back his ex-wife Tracy.

00:02:29.941 --> 00:02:31.568
She's actually my wife now.

00:02:31.776 --> 00:02:32.735
For the moment.

00:02:33.736 --> 00:02:35.989
And Ed finally gets out
from behind the desk

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:38.825
to prepare for his mission
aboard the Pathfinder.

00:02:39.284 --> 00:02:42.954
Meanwhile, NASA and the Soviets
create an uneasy alliance to

00:02:42.954 --> 00:02:45.206
prove there is peace
between the two,

00:02:45.206 --> 00:02:48.293
working together to make
a connection in space.

00:02:48.668 --> 00:02:50.253
But some of us...

00:02:50.253 --> 00:02:52.172
To our shared secrets.

00:02:52.297 --> 00:02:54.716
-Make more of a
connection than others.

00:02:55.842 --> 00:02:59.012
And speaking of
more than an alliance.

00:02:59.012 --> 00:03:01.639
Ellen manages a reconnection
of her own, with Pam.

00:03:01.890 --> 00:03:03.975
Would it be weird for us
to get a drink sometime?

00:03:03.975 --> 00:03:05.393
I mean it would be...

00:03:05.393 --> 00:03:06.394
Nice.

00:03:08.021 --> 00:03:11.399
And Karen, well, she finds

00:03:11.399 --> 00:03:15.028
comfort in the Outpost
basement with Danny Stevens.

00:03:15.945 --> 00:03:16.946
Come on!

00:03:17.822 --> 00:03:18.573
What?

00:03:18.573 --> 00:03:19.324
(squeals)

00:03:19.574 --> 00:03:20.658
I can't, I just can't.

00:03:20.825 --> 00:03:22.202
Yes, she, does.

00:03:22.202 --> 00:03:23.286
Get it Karen!

00:03:24.996 --> 00:03:25.872
Yes!

00:03:26.581 --> 00:03:27.582
(clears throat)

00:03:30.210 --> 00:03:32.003
Seriously? Gordo's son?

00:03:33.171 --> 00:03:37.592
Anyway, while, sparks
fly on Earth,

00:03:37.592 --> 00:03:39.969
gunshots are raining
down on Jamestown.

00:03:40.678 --> 00:03:41.930
A stray bullet hits the cooling

00:03:41.930 --> 00:03:44.057
pump of Jamestown's
nuclear reactor.

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:46.309
And it's only a matter of
time before it explodes,

00:03:46.309 --> 00:03:48.478
killing everyone on the Moon.

00:03:50.480 --> 00:03:52.482
And it's my character
Aleida Rosales.

00:03:53.316 --> 00:03:55.026
Yep! That's young me with Margo,

00:03:55.026 --> 00:03:56.986
except that doesn't go so well.

00:03:57.028 --> 00:03:59.530
Maybe I could stay with you...

00:04:00.823 --> 00:04:03.618
I'm sorry, I shouldn't
have asked.

00:04:04.661 --> 00:04:05.662
Which lead to...

00:04:06.829 --> 00:04:10.083
I can offer you a job at NASA.

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:12.168
Ah. Poor little Mexican girl,

00:04:12.168 --> 00:04:13.544
you know, she got
a big job at NASA

00:04:13.544 --> 00:04:15.255
'cause Margo Madison
took pity on her.

00:04:15.546 --> 00:04:17.465
I didn't come here out of pity.

00:04:17.465 --> 00:04:18.383
Guilt's a close cousin.

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:20.218
Yeah, not great.

00:04:20.218 --> 00:04:21.678
But, it gets...

00:04:21.678 --> 00:04:22.679
Better.

00:04:23.429 --> 00:04:24.264
Yes!

00:04:24.973 --> 00:04:26.349
What I'm really
trying to get to,

00:04:26.349 --> 00:04:28.726
is she's the one who notices
the message from Gordo

00:04:28.726 --> 00:04:30.270
that Jamestown is under attack.

00:04:30.478 --> 00:04:31.312
Hello?

00:04:31.437 --> 00:04:32.272
Hi.

00:04:32.981 --> 00:04:35.566
And this leads to a powerful,

00:04:35.566 --> 00:04:37.860
pivotal moment, for
Gordo and Tracy.

00:04:38.444 --> 00:04:41.447
The nuclear reactor's control
computer has gone offline.

00:04:42.156 --> 00:04:42.991
What can we do?

00:04:43.199 --> 00:04:46.286
Together again, they
make their final stand...

00:04:46.828 --> 00:04:48.037
And save Jamestown.

00:04:48.371 --> 00:04:52.583
(intense music playing)

00:04:52.834 --> 00:04:53.876
You.

00:04:53.876 --> 00:04:55.295
Will. Be.

00:04:55.795 --> 00:04:56.629
Missed.

00:04:59.841 --> 00:05:01.884
At the same time,
Dani goes rogue,

00:05:01.884 --> 00:05:04.512
and disobeys direct orders
to abort her mission.

00:05:05.096 --> 00:05:06.931
She docks with the Soyuz...

00:05:08.224 --> 00:05:09.517
And peace is restored.

00:05:11.060 --> 00:05:13.730
(crowd cheering)

00:05:13.730 --> 00:05:15.440
The handshake in space has

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:17.150
become a handshake
to save the world.

00:05:17.692 --> 00:05:19.610
President Reagan was so moved

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:21.321
by the images that
it inspired him

00:05:21.321 --> 00:05:23.156
to reach out his
own hand in peace.

00:05:23.156 --> 00:05:25.033
Our final shot of season 2

00:05:25.033 --> 00:05:28.036
gives us a tease of what's
to come in season 3.

00:05:28.286 --> 00:05:29.579
Hint. Hint.

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:34.083
This leaves one key question:

00:05:34.083 --> 00:05:35.710
Whose boots are they?

00:05:38.171 --> 00:05:39.547
I guess you'll have to find out.

